Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}We now have three clusters, and none of the remaining positive-affinity merges is legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}现在有三个簇，剩余亲和度为正的合并都不合法。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:09.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The algorithm stops even though target K is two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:09.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}虽然目标 K 为二，算法仍必须停止。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}This target is fundamentally infeasible: two clusters of capacity two hold only four units.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}这个目标本身不可行：两个容量为二的簇最多容纳四个大小单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:22.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Our graph contains five units, so no algorithm can satisfy both requirements.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:22.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}图中共有五个大小单位，因此任何算法都无法同时满足这两个要求。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:27.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The result respects capacity, but target reached must be reported as false.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:27.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}结果符合容量约束，但“是否达到目标”必须报告为否。
